            <div class="content-item__info">
                    <h3 class="content-item__title">How Do MotoGP™ Riders Train Their Reflexes? The Science of Split-Second Reactions</h3>
                    <p class="content-item__description">MotoGP riders react in milliseconds at 360km/h. Learn how they train their reflexes, from light boards and motocross, to mental prep and sports psychology.</p>
